CVE-2026-58050
CVE-2026-7598
# curl/libcurl - Wrong file transfer due to incorrect SMB connection reuse
CVE-2026-5773
# openssl/libssl3 - Heap Use-After-Free in PKCS7_verify
CVE-2026-45447

